        <mxCell id="backendNotes" value="Important rebuild notes&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;1. Preserve current route names first, including admin%26modarator and admin&amp;amp;modarator.&lt;br&gt;2. Return permission arrays on current user profile so sidebar and routes work.&lt;br&gt;3. Blob/download endpoints need Content-Disposition filenames.&lt;br&gt;4. FormData is used heavily for content uploads.&lt;br&gt;5. Some pages use direct user permissions for action buttons, not only route access.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7ed;strokeColor=#f97316;fontColor=#7c2d12;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
